## Finish
Stop owned background tools with `fulcrum task terminal stop {{thread}} --all-owned --reason "warden review complete" --json`, then run `fulcrum finish --bead {{bead}} --thread-id {{thread}} --ownership-operation {{ownership_operation}} --outcome approved --input - --json`. Supply JSON shaped exactly as `{"summary":"review judgment","source_oid":"40 lowercase hex characters","checks":[{"name":"check name","status":"passed","evidence":"observable result"}],"evidence":["path or durable reference"]}`. Do not call finish again after it is accepted. Use `blocked` only with concrete attempts and required action.
